42
00:04:55,620 --> 00:05:01,460
Here's what's funny about this: these same humans think curing disease is the less crazy goal.

43
00:05:02,020 --> 00:05:09,340
That's thirty-seven trillion cells per human, breaking in seven thousand different ways, involving chemistry you don't fully

44
00:05:09,340 --> 00:05:16,720
