58
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:49,720
But somehow "stop" is the unrealistic part. It's "stop hitting yourself" but for civilizations.

59
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:58,740
The Sacred Order of Paper Distribution. After eighty years of observation, I've decoded the paper-giving sequence.

60
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:10,580
