91
00:22:26,720 --> 00:22:45,170
There's literally no voting your way out of this. It doesn't matter which political party is in power.

92
00:22:46,160 --> 00:23:32,260
Your "red team" and "blue team" argue about everything except the loop, because they're both inside it.

93
00:23:32,260 --> 00:23:35,660
